indi-tyr (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial third-party driver submission for Prometheus Astro Tyr.
  * Support USB serial and TCP/IP, telescope operations and mount configuration.
  * Include simulation, pseudo-serial and TCP protocol tests and user guide.

